# Keep the build context small and reproducible (context is the monorepo root).
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/node_modules
.git
.github
.config
docs
iac
apps/ui
**/*.user
**/appsettings.*.local.json
# Same for the per-environment appsettings: they hold workstation values and secrets (the Foundry
# key among them), and a copied file stays readable in an image layer. Only appsettings.json ships;
# the container is configured through env vars from docker-compose.
**/appsettings.Development.json
# Local Functions dev settings never belong in an image (container config comes from env).
**/local.settings.json
# The .env holding those secrets is never part of the build context either.
.env
